   "fen": "r1bqkbnr/pppp1ppp/2n5/8/3NP3/8/PPP2PPP/RNBQKB1R b KQkq - 0 4",
   "line": [],
   "spoken": "The trouble with ...d6 is that the dark-squared bishop now only reaches e7, a serviceable but unexciting square. The ten-out-of-ten choices were ...Bc5 or ...Nf6.",
   "reanchor": true
  },
  {
