   "fen": "r1bqkb1r/ppp2p1p/2np1np1/8/2BNP3/2N5/PPP2PPP/R1BQK2R w KQkq - 0 7",
   "line": [
    "g6"
   ],
   "spoken": "Black plays g6 to fianchetto — but notice the queens standing off along the d-file, and Black's queen guarded only by the knight and the king."
